Do: Project the complete live actor layer collectively across tick transitions: spawn visibility, Farmer removal, Arsonist removal, Forester movement, Fighter pursuit/collision, destination conflicts, and changing occupancy. Use piece-owned visible journal inputs and explicit malformed-radius errors.
